          "title": "Use PipVision",
          "type": 3,
          "enable": 1,
          "mouse": "Press once: capture the scene. Press twice: set the targeted NPC portrait. Hold: have the nearest NPC describe the scene. Requires SUP NVSE 8.55 or newer.",
